                <head>The International Council of Premiers: Minutes of Meetings (1919–1920):</head>
                <p>[The minutes here printed are only those of the meetings of the International
                    Council of Premiers at which representatives of the United States were present
                    prior to the termination of the Peace Conference at Paris on January 21, 1920.
                    The files of the Department of State do not contain minutes of the meetings of
                    this Council at which the United States was not represented.]</p>

















